Changes made (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): this file's sibling sample.jsonl is a
modified, derived subset of the Gretel test split. The original `entities`
lists were converted into character-offset spans in the PII-GuardBench schema,
entity types were mapped onto this benchmark's categories (unmapped types were
dropped), and 500 records were sampled with a fixed seed. The text of each kept
record is unchanged. See README.md and conversion_stats.json in this folder.

The full dataset is not redistributed here. The documents are synthetic
(generated with Gretel Navigator, mistral-nemo-2407), not real user text.

